What:		/sys/touchpanel/oplus_backlight
Date:		October 2026
Description:
		Oplus brightness compatibility interface from commit
		6c443046467af318d998bab2daeb017ffbbeee14, adapted to SDE.
		Requires CONFIG_TOUCHSCREEN_COMMON and CONFIG_PAPER_OPLUS_BACKLIGHT.
		The attribute is registered after panel0-backlight and removed
		before that panel's backlight is unregistered. Reads return EOF.

		Writes accept unsigned decimal integers, optionally suffixed with
		".0" and a newline. Values <= 222 map to code 1, values >= 8191
		map to 4095, with rounded linear interpolation in between.
		Zero therefore requests minimum brightness, as in the donor.
		Codes are normalized to the native panel brightness maximum;
		thermal limits and panel blanking/suspend remain in effect.

		Invalid input returns EINVAL; absent panel returns ENODEV.
		Backlight update errors are propagated to the writer.
